      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**POWER OF ATTORNEY**\nWexner acknowledged giving Epstein broad authority over his personal finances. He also described an early-1990s foundation trusteeship without executive responsibilities.\nHis letter does not establish authority over ‘life and death.’ [W01]",
        "fontSize" : 17,
