      "rotation" : -0.6,
      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**2005 → 2008 / FLORIDA**\nPolice investigation began in 2005. A federal non-prosecution agreement followed on **24 Sep 2007**. On **30 Jun 2008**, Epstein pleaded guilty to felony solicitation of prostitution and procurement of minors to engage in prostitution; the court imposed **18 months**. [E01]",
        "fontSize" : 17,
        "style" : "note"
      },
      "tint" : "azure",
      "type" : "text",
      "z" : 25
    },
    {
