      "rotation" : -0.3,
      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**8 JUL 2019 / FEDERAL CHARGES**\nSDNY alleged sex trafficking of minors and conspiracy, involving paid recruitment and abuse in New York and Florida in 2002–2005.\n**Allegations; Epstein was not tried.** [E02]",
        "fontSize" : 17,
        "style" : "note"
      },
      "tint" : "amber",
      "type" : "text",
      "z" : 27
    },
    {
