      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**2023 / CUSTODY FAILURES**\nThe Inspector General documented serious supervision and prison failures. Its report records the medical examiner’s suicide finding for **10 Aug 2019**, and the FBI’s finding of no criminality in how Epstein died. [E06]",
