      "id" : "80882E27-3E4E-46CF-B12F-283011D931AE",
      "locked" : false,
      "modifiedAt" : "2026-11-06T20:29:53Z",
      "rotation" : 1.4,
      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**WHAT THE TEACHING SAYS**\nChabad describes ‘wisdom, understanding and knowledge’ as its intellectual framework and discusses Jewish mysticism. This supplies religious context, not evidence of criminal conduct. [R02]",
        "fontSize" : 17,
        "style" : "note"
      },
      "tint" : "violet",
      "type" : "text",
      "z" : 55
    },
    {
      "createdAt" : "2026-11-05T15:51:06Z",
      "frame" : {
        "height" : 302,
        "width" : 300,
        "x" : 2670,
        "y" : 1550
      },
      "id" : "E579604B-E58C-42E5-A8DF-0829DB99A2B1",
      "locked" : false,
      "modifiedAt" : "2026-11-06T20:29:53Z",
      "rotation" : -0.9,
      "text" : {
        "alignment" : "leading",
        "autoHeight" : true,
        "content" : "**UNSOURCED KEYWORDS**\nAstrology, alchemy, sacred geometry, reincarnation and possession were on the initial board. The cited sources do not establish these as Epstein’s interests or Chabad practices. Each needs its own source.",
        "fontSize" : 17,
        "style" : "note"
      },
      "tint" : "amber",
      "type" : "text",
      "z" : 56
    }
  ],
